{"title":"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The table below shows the distance <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> in feet a ball rolls down an inclined plane in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> seconds.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/8/4688fffd4c2b1d8e1af133c2b756c657e25e5438.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{tabular}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline t &amp; 0 &amp; 1 &amp; 2 &amp; 3 &amp; 4 &amp; 5\\\\ \\hline s &amp; 0 &amp; 10 &amp; 40 &amp; 90 &amp; 160 &amp; 250\\\\ \\hline\\end{tabular}\\]\" width=\"255\" height=\"42\" />\nThe distance <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/5/8e551f18328e368723d63ba45fc33af3d5e52959.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t = 2.5$\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/1/221e0bb7e54af160d9d2d72c3b92e78586b6de06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 45\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 62.5\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 70\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 75\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 82.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"422\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Looking at the pattern, we can determine that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/0/c00de52add04dde0ee65eed0d1ea4d473056bb20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=10s^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"63\" height=\"15\" />. Applying the relationship, we can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3eadb0ee3b83f3a0fd364139ee28d23ff6802e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }62.5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"113\" height=\"30\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/6/016db21d011ee2529161bcb9f0c9ba2b800646a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=2.5$\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME\" title=\"1957 AHSME\">1957 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1957 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1957\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" ali